   "function": "problem",
   "scene_type": "zlx_chart",
   "spoken": "The valve timing diagram shows valve lift over crank angle. It spans two turns, seven hundred and twenty degrees, because the camshaft turns only half as fast as the crankshaft. The curves show how far each valve is open at any moment.",
