  {
   "id": "b5",
   "function": "demonstration",
   "scene_type": "zlx_cutaway",
   "spoken": "Each number has a reason. Opening early lets the cylinder pressure escape before the exhaust stroke. Closing late uses the momentum of the incoming air at high engine speed. Both are about getting gas in and out as well as possible.",
